+ * Check if a syscall is lightweight enough to preserve RSEQ grants through.
+ * Lightweight syscalls:
+ * - Don't block or wait for I/O
+ * - Don't context switch to another process
+ * - Execute in microseconds and return immediately
+ *
+ * Allowing grants to survive through these syscalls significantly improves
+ * grant utilization for applications that do quick housekeeping calls
+ * (like signal mask manipulation) between actual CPU-intensive work.
